  "notes": "S3 buckets (primary versioned bucket with KMS encryption and access logging, log bucket, replica bucket, 15-minute RTC) come from a registry module in the ground truth and are not visible in the normalised input, so they cannot be checked. EBS snapshot preservation values live in a local, so local_exec checks only that the provisioner sets the snapshot-preservation setting. Optional capabilities use __declared__. Provisioning the key and buckets only when IP sets, threat intel sets or S3 publishing are enabled is not required: the prompt says they must exist when enabled, not only then."
